{{/* Adapted from Gitea templates/org/team/new.tmpl (MIT), using existing private organization and repository grants. */}}
<form class="ui form" data-api="/api/v1/organizations/{{.Org.ID}}/teams" data-next="{{.OrgSection "teams"}}"><h3 class="ui top attached header">新建团队</h3><div class="ui attached segment"><div class="required field"><label for="team_name">团队名称</label><input id="team_name" data-name-validation="团队名称" name="Name" required maxlength="80" autofocus pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9][a-zA-Z0-9_.\-]{0,79}"><p class="muted">须以字母或数字开头，可包含字母、数字、点、下划线和连字符；不能包含空格，最长 80 个字符。</p></div><div class="field"><label for="team_description">团队描述</label><input id="team_description" name="Description" maxlength="255"><p class="muted">描述团队的目的或作用。</p></div><div class="field"><label>可见性</label><p>所属组织内可见，组织保持私有。</p></div><div class="field"><label>仓库权限</label><p>指定仓库：团队成员只能浏览授权给此团队的仓库。</p></div><button class="ui primary button">创建团队</button><a class="ui button" href="{{.OrgSection "teams"}}">取消</a></div></form>
